    ### page 61 ###
    # > INT. DAY; CROWN MILITARY RESEARCH LAB.
    takeshi "Hey if anyone is listening to this after the fact, Usagi Kitadani didn’t know anything! I never told her a thing. She might have had her suspicions, but she didn’t know the extent.... Anyway... I’m going to the Bakersfield Dome in the California region. Take care of yourself, Usagi."
    sanders "And that’s the recording we retrieved."
    usagi "I can’t believe you’ve been spying on me."
    jojo "Everywhere you turn these days... traitors to the crown. Kitadani, the work we’re doing here is too important to bungle... and messing up could mean the end of everyone."
    sanders "... which is exactly what we’re trying to prevent. But it can’t happen if people like... him... are running around trying to undermine the crown-"
    usagi "Just admit it George. You never liked Takeshi because he’s a colony born. A Lunar."
    sanders "... It’s them and their WACKY beliefs that got us here in the first place."
    bart "Watch your mouth. Those are the scriptures you’re talking about."
    ### page 62 ###
    jojo "Usagi, if you do not follow directions for... Project Kaguya... then we will be forced to send Sanders here after your friend."
    usagi ".... Fine. I’ll do what you say. Just leave Takeshi out of it."
    jojo "Then shall we begin for today?"
    usagi "Sanders. You remember our first summer together, when we visited Earth? Takeshi’s first time?"
    sanders "Yeah. He was freaking out about cars. Really loved the idea of a road trip.... He wouldn’t stop talking about it for the rest of the year."
    usagi "Takeshi never hated Earth, Sanders. Remember that."
    kagu "Hey mom, what’s up?"
    usagi "Oh, hey Kagu... Wow... you’re pretty fluent. Its only been a few days since I last saw-"
    kagu "That’s right. But after all, I AM a sentient cosmic being that alters its appearance to fit the confines of your human mind, after all."
    usagi "Oh wow."
    kagu "Yeah, pretty impressive, huh? My development is awfully fast by your standards. When you found me in the crystal, I had been regenerating for almost 17 years. But now that I’m out? Time to learn everything I can about you humans. You’re really interesting."
    ### page 63 ###
    usagi "Regenerating?"
    kagu "Yeah, after my past life ended. I regenerate. I’ve been watching dramas. I think you humans don’t regenerate when your life leaves you."
    usagi "Yeah... no. Hey Kagu, so you don’t remember anything from before? From... your past life?"
    kagu "It’s kind of... how would you say...? Foggy? I can kind of remember some things, but it’s all a blur right now."
    bart "This is exactly the right path Joseph, soon it will remember its true purpose."
    jojo "That would be a BAD thing, Bart... Let her work, she’s probably the only one who can... repurpose it."
    bart "..."
    usagi "How can I help you remember?"
    kagu "Well, the story you told me really helped expand my mind. From there, I was able to piece a whole bunch of things together. Then Professor Jojo back there, he gave me a holo device. That’s how I watch the dramas. Have you seen the series, I got hit by a bus and now my love triangle of friends are rpg heroes? That one cracks me up!"
    usagi "Actually... I do know that one. It’s pretty good. The part with the pirate cats was hilarious."
    ### page 64 ###
    # > A glitch
    kagu "THE PIRATE CATS! HAHA!"
    usagi "What was that?"
    kagu "That was.... When a part of me evolves, that happens. Laughter... with... another person. Camaraderie. First... Wonder... when you read me the story, remember? And now... Camaraderie. Wow... Thank you Usagi."
    usagi "I see...."
    bart "No, Joseph this is not right-"
    jojo "Bart! How many times do I have to tell you!? Let-Her-Work!"
    bart "But she’s doing it wrong, shes..."
    usagi ".... Kagu... what do you desire? What do you... want? What are your hopes, and dreams?"
    # > Glitch glitch glitch
    kagu "Hopes... and... dreams?"
    # > Glitch glitch glitch
    bart "No! She knows what she is doing! She’s HUMANIZING IT!"
    kagu "Hopes.... And .... Dreams..... What do I want?"
